---
// Invoice automation diagrams for /projects/casual-services-invoice-automation.
// On narrow screens the monthly run and the ledger states are separate files. The
// run is drawn as steps, not components, so stacking it top to bottom stays true
// (docs/phase-3-plan.md).
import InlineDiagram from './InlineDiagram.astro';
import desktop from '../../assets/diagrams/invoice-automation-desktop.svg?raw';
import mobileRun from '../../assets/diagrams/invoice-automation-mobile-run.svg?raw';
import mobileState from '../../assets/diagrams/invoice-automation-mobile-state.svg?raw';
---

<InlineDiagram desktop={desktop} mobile={[mobileRun, mobileState]}>
	A scheduled Lambda reserves the invoice number, saves the PDF and the email, and
	leaves one Gmail draft. I send it and confirm the send myself. If the Gmail request
	has an unknown outcome, a retry looks for the existing draft before doing anything
	else.
</InlineDiagram>
